<title>USA: Freight Connection Inc 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Freight Connection Inc 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>			12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.06		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net		 271			448</p>
<p> Revs		22,170		   20,001</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  4,826		    4,826</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q4 1996 net income was $59,000 on revenues of $5.74 million, compared with net income of $186,000 on revenues of $4.58 million for Q4 1995. Per share data were not given.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
